file": "PRD-Flash.md", "source_location": "\u00a74.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Badges are scope-independent (derived from is_read in the DB) so they update live from any tab, distinct from session-read visibility which is per-tab; an unawaited authoritative re-query self-heals drift."}, {"id": "prd_flash_article_feed", "label": "Article Feed / Card Layout", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PRD-Flash.md", "source_location": "\u00a74.3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "prd_flash_auto_refresh_on_open", "label": "Auto-Refresh on Open (cold-start bolt animation)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PRD-Flash.md", "source_location": "\u00a74.3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "prd_flash_resume_refresh", "label": "Auto-Refresh on Resume (ResumeRefreshPolicy)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PRD-Flash.md", "source_location": "\u00a74.3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "prd_flash_session_read_model", "label": "Session-Read Model (per-tab visibility)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "PRD-Flash.md", "source_location": "\u00a74.3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An article marked read in one tab's scope stays dimmed-in-place only in that tab and is absent from every other tab, symmetric across tabs; kept per-tab (not global) so the actively-scrolled list never collapses/jumps under the user's thumb while still narrowing visibility scope from 'every tab' to 'the tab it was read in'. SessionReadTracker keys by scope (kAllScope or folder id)."}, {"id": "prd_flash_sessionreadtracker", "label": "SessionReadTracker", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "PRD-Flash.md", "source_location": "\u00a74.3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contribu